category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel
sdesc: "Cross-platform clipboard library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libclipboard is a cross-platform clipboard library written in C.
It supports reading and writing text on the Windows, X11 and macOS
clipboards, and provides custom allocator support."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/jtanx/libclipboard
license: MIT
